Z||000004||conductor||12-05-2001||10:20 AM||||Sorry, I mean Jelly of course  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>But are you sure, cause I read somewhere that the IAC different is on an 84?<BR>So do I have to put my 86 IAC in the 84 TB or will the 84IAC in the 84TB work for my 86 4cyl?<BR>Thnx Richard||||reg||1
